OL,3,GNEWSA'Unacceptable' postal delays
OL,4,Acontinue in South East
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman says she has sometimes gone
OL,7,Fweeks without a postal delivery to her
OL,8,Fhome near Dorking then had 35 pieces of
OL,9,Fpost arrive in one go, as MPs across
OL,10,Fthe South East say their inboxes are
OL,11,Ffull of similar cases in their areas.
OL,13,FNatasha Knight said she had missed one
OL,14,Fmedical appointment, paid a credit card
OL,15,Fbill late and had been left with little
OL,16,Ftime to take action set out in a letter
OL,17,Ffrom HMRC due to late post.
OL,19,FSeven MPs from Kent and Sussex have now
OL,20,Fwritten to Royal Mail and the
OL,21,Fgovernment about what they describe as
OL,22,F"persistent failures."
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,322,320,200,140,0,100
