OL,3,GNEWSA'Unacceptable' postal delays
OL,4,Acontinue in South East
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government has branded the delays
OL,7,F"unacceptable for too long." Royal Mail
OL,8,Fsaid its service had improved but it
OL,9,Frecognised there was "more to do".
